<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">directory <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title">Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">This policy describes the current behavior of this static portfolio website.</p></section><p class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION</p><h2 id="section-1">Information you choose to share</h2><p>The contact page currently provides email and WhatsApp links rather than a website-hosted message form. If you contact me, the information you send is handled through the service you choose and may be stored in that service.</p><h2 id="section-2">Analytics and cookies</h2><p>Google Analytics is not configured in this package. No analytics tracking code or analytics consent banner is active by default. If analytics or other non-essential tracking is added later, this policy and consent behavior must be updated before deployment, including appropriate consent for visitors where required by law.</p><h2 id="section-3">External links</h2><p>This site links to third-party websites and social platforms. Those services have their own privacy policies and practices, which I do not control.</p><h2 id="section-4">Hosting and security</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical request data such as IP addresses and request logs to deliver and protect the site. Consult the hosting provider’s current policy for details.</p><h2 id="section-5">Changes</h2><p>This notice should be revised if the site begins collecting form submissions, using analytics, running advertising pixels, or processing other personal information.</p><h2 id="section-6">Contact</h2><p>Questions about this notice: <a href="mailto:Bakhtawark085@gmail.com">Bakhtawark085@gmail.com</a>.</p>
